{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready?...Go!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SINKER is a first-person momentum-based speedrunner where you navigate tricky obstacles to reach the goal as fast as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Quick Levels - Tricky Execution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In SINKER, it's all about going for that<strong>\u00a0<i>perfect time </i></strong>(or at least a better time than your friends!). Most levels only take a couple of seconds to beat, which leaves more time to grind for an even better time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find YOUR Way - No Invisible Walls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All levels have a<i>\u00a0normal</i>\u00a0way of getting to the finish line, but nothing is stopping you from finding your own, faster way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711160?t=1746728521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711160/f9c5cddcf9ab5349f85048ff812f865957ded913/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746728521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711160/18e116908e4c685733b674c480726ff98134576a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746728521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711160/18e116908e4c685733b674c480726ff98134576a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746728521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready?...Go!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SINKER is a first-person momentum-based speedrunner where you navigate tricky obstacles to reach the goal as fast as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Quick Levels - Tricky Execution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In SINKER, it's all about going for that<strong>\u00a0<i>perfect time </i></strong>(or at least a better time than your friends!). Most levels